      "full_name": "Richie Cartwright",
      "title": "Founder",
      "founder_bio": "Co-founder of Fella Health, the telemedicine clinic for men with obesity. Serving 1 million fellas by 2026.\nInspired by my own 6-year secret battle with binge eating disorder.\n\nBefore Fella, I founded an AI company (FlowX) working with the UK government. FlowX applied a layer of computer vision to existing CCTV cameras to extract transport data, to help ease congestion. FlowX was acquired after we won a $650k contract with the UK Department for Transport.",
